/* ---------- Memory trainer: the lines ----------
 * The lines the memory trainer reads aloud (docs/features/memory-trainer.md).
 * Not loaded by the app yet: the trainer (M2) will fetch this file when it
 * opens. Nothing here ships to users until Jose has checked every Spanish line.
 *
 * Each line:
 *   id      'ff-<word>' for a False Friends starter, 'en-NN' / 'es-NN' for
 *           the longer lines (the language the line is read in)
 *   from    'es' or 'en': the language read aloud; you render into the other
 *   who     'patient', 'family' or 'provider'
 *   topic   ED, meds, consent, discharge, OB, peds (starters: their FF tag)
 *   text    what is read aloud
 *   render  the model rendering
 *   chunks  meaning chunks in the rendering's order, each [in text, in render];
 *           after your turn you tap the chunks you dropped or changed
 *
 * The starters are the False Friends `heard` lines with their `truth` as the
 * rendering; tests/suites/trainer-lines.cjs fails if they drift from
 * FALSE_FRIENDS in index.html. Three have a cleaned rendering where the
 * truth carries a note or advice (desorden, estómago, severo); seven are left out because their truth
 * is "ask which one", not a rendering: aborto, argumento, bizarro, seno,
 * derrame, ataque, pecho.
 */
